Package: karyoparser
Title: Parse ISCN Karyotype Strings
Version: 0.9.4
Authors@R:
    person("Luca", "Lanino", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "luca@lanino.me")
Description: Parses ISCN (International System for Human Cytogenomic
    Nomenclature) karyotype strings into structured binary features for
    analysis. Focused on myeloid neoplasm-related chromosomal aberrations.
